OL,3,GNEWSAComeback plan for town anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council hopes to tackle ongoing
OL,7,Fanti-social behaviour including street
OL,8,Fdrinking, begging and drug misuse by
OL,9,Frestoring a public space protection
OL,10,Forder (PSPO).
OL,12,FNorth Northamptonshire Council is
OL,13,Fproposing to reintroduce a PSPO in
OL,14,FKettering after it was unable to renew
OL,15,Fthe previous order in time.
OL,17,FData from Northamptonshire Police has
OL,18,Fidentified ongoing anti-social
OL,19,Fbehaviour in the town with the highest
OL,20,Fnumber of incidents recorded on High
OL,21,FStreet, Lower Street, Gold Street and
OL,22,FCarrington Street.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
