OL,3,GNEWSAComeback plan for town anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour order
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreg Wilcox, Reform UK councillor and
OL,7,Fexecutive member for communities, said:
OL,8,F"We want Kettering town centre to be a
OL,9,Fplace where people feel safe, welcome
OL,10,Fand able to enjoy everything it has to
OL,11,Foffer."
